rveillance quality was assessed for 28 priority countries both at the national level and at 511 first administrative subnational\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"R software (version 4.3.1; R Foundation) was used to conduct all analyses.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"Total represents weighted mean percentage of regional performance.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Percentage of the country’s population aged <15 years living in subnational areas that met both surveillance indicators\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}